      "identity_excerpt": "700-00001SM – Petition to Open Small Estate (09/2023) Page 1 of 2 STATE OF VERMONT SUPERIOR COURT PROBATE DIVISION Unit Case No. In re ESTATE of: PETITION TO OPEN SMALL ESTATE 14 V.S.A. Ch. 81 __________________________________ was a resident of ______________________________________ Decedent Town/State and died on ________________________ leaving personal property valued at $45,000 or less and no real estate. Decedent left: ☐ No known Last Will and Testament OR ☐ Last Will and Testament dated _______________________ ☐ Codicil(s) to the Will, if any, dated ____________________ Attached are: 1. Filing fee; checks or money orders payable to Vermont Superior Court, 2. Original or Certified copy of the death certificate, 3. List of Interested Persons (form 700-00002), 4. ORIGINAL Will and Codicils, if any, 5. Inventory of the estate, including information or estimates available at the time of filing (form 700-00030), 6. Affidavit of paid and outstanding funeral expenses and any other known or reasonably ascertainable debts of the decedent (form 700-00402), 7. Bond without surety in the amount of the fair market value of the estate. Petitioner requests a small estate be opened and the following named person be appointed to administer the estate: _______________________________________________________________________ Proposed Executor/Administrator _______________________________________________________________________ Mailing Address ___________________________________ /___________________________________ Telephone Email ☐ This is the person named as executor in the Will. ACCEPTANCE OF APPOINTMENT I accept the appointment as Executor/Administrator and ask that the appointment documents be issued to me at the address above. _______________________________ ____________________",
